{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 3669,
    "dDurationMs": 5221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was outside on my first space walk,\nI was on the dark side of the world over the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8890,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Indian Ocean and I shut off all the lights\nin my suit to let my eyes adjust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15010,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as I came south of Australia in the darkness,\nwe drove through the southern lights and they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21210,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were like pouring underneath my feet and you\ncould see all the colors of it and, I mean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25410,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had seen aurora from on the surface of the\nearth, but to be amongst them, to actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31590,
    "dDurationMs": 5309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "directly be part of that interaction between\nthe sun and the atmosphere and the magnetic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36899,
    "dDurationMs": 5631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "field all right there visually like a prism\nor a rainbow or something, that was a real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42530,
    "dDurationMs": 5219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reality check of how it is all related and\nhow the energy of the sun and the protection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47749,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the atmosphere and the focus of the magnetic\nfield all work together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52550,
    "dDurationMs": 2059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really showed me that this is a system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54609,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a planetary system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56269,
    "dDurationMs": 1671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This goes on all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57940,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of the time, though, we just don’t\nsee it, but this is going on constantly, all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61670,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the time, how all those things work together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64750,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From orbit you get that type or perspective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67280,
    "dDurationMs": 4879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see the fact that this is a complicated\nsystem that is subject to a lot of influences,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72159,
    "dDurationMs": 3081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is going on all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75240,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the influences that is affecting earth\nitself, of course, is the beings that are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80960,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "living on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81960,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Volcanoes erupting, but also the plant life\nand the animal life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86350,
    "dDurationMs": 6170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And over the last 100 years, I mean, gosh,\nour numbers have rocketed until seven billion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92520,
    "dDurationMs": 4309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of us are ell simultaneously exhaling and\neating and turning on our lights in our house"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96829,
    "dDurationMs": 3371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and starting up the engines in our cars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100200,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Obviously that has an effect on the planet\nin amongst all those other things happening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104270,
    "dDurationMs": 2529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see some of those effects from space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106799,
    "dDurationMs": 1661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see with your naked eye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108460,
    "dDurationMs": 6299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you come across Mexico City or Beijing,\nthe pollution is visible from space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114759,
    "dDurationMs": 5570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is like a grey, ugly smear on the surface\nof the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120329,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That this man made local climate change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123149,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you come across Asia..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125219,
    "dDurationMs": 3611,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On my very first flight there was a big inland\nsea, the Aral Sea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128830,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was still a relatively healthy body of\nwater back in the early 90s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133180,
    "dDurationMs": 7139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But over the last 20 years, because of agricultural\npolicies and irrigation policies, the Aral"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140319,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sea has gone from being the fourth biggest\nsea on earth, to being virtually non-existent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144849,
    "dDurationMs": 2331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is dried up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147180,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we did it on purpose as a species."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149459,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We made a conscious decision to allow the\nfourth biggest sea in the world to turn into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154879,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a little stinking puddle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157409,
    "dDurationMs": 6030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What used to be a shore line is now empty\nsand and the remains of the fertilizer that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163439,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were drained into that sea for decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165900,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are obviously changing the climate at a\nglobal level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170010,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The key is: Who is going to be the person\nthat is going to decide to change something?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174650,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can’t wait for some other person to change\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179430,
    "dDurationMs": 4479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don’t have the imperative to do it,\nespecially if they are someone that we elected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183909,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we elected, they are just our representative\nand the real motivation comes to each of us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188159,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "individually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189579,
    "dDurationMs": 2091,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is who has to make the change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191670,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can’t say they or him or her or it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195180,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is us or me or I that has to make the change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199420,
    "dDurationMs": 3539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is not going to be perfect and it is\ngoing to have to get a little bit critical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202959,
    "dDurationMs": 4151,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before people are truly going to feel enough\npain or enough compunction to actually change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207110,
    "dDurationMs": 1799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what they are doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208909,
    "dDurationMs": 2991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And things are going to get worse before they\nget better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211900,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I am confident this isn’t the end of\nthe world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215930,
    "dDurationMs": 4790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is just a problem that we are facing\nthat is going to change things, but we are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220720,
    "dDurationMs": 2859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to have to figure out a way to deal\nwith it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223579,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I am just..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227939,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Got enough light?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229829,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah, I am wondering if the sun is setting\non us there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232230,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e We can turn..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233439,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234439,
    "dDurationMs": 3151,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The sun is not only setting on us."
    } ]
  } ]
}
